1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,237
SuryaSetu video guide, part one. A quick tour of the app.

2
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:13,317
SuryaSetu runs your whole solar business in one place: enquiries, site surveys,

3
00:00:13,317 --> 00:00:19,171
quotations, installation, stock, GST bills, subsidy and service.

4
00:00:19,171 --> 00:00:23,104
After you sign in, you see the Home screen.

5
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:25,709
Each tile is one app.

6
00:00:25,709 --> 00:00:28,218
CRM is for leads and customers.

7
00:00:28,218 --> 00:00:31,293
Sales has site surveys and quotations.

8
00:00:31,293 --> 00:00:35,339
Projects and Installation follow the work at site.

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:40,108
Inventory and Purchase keep your stock and orders.

10
00:00:40,108 --> 00:00:43,117
Accounts has GST invoices and payments.

11
00:00:43,117 --> 00:00:47,284
Subsidy, Solar Loans and Service complete the picture.

12
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:50,691
Open an app by tapping its tile.

13
00:00:50,691 --> 00:00:57,309
The menu at the top shows the lists inside it, like Leads, Customers and Activities.

14
00:00:58,210 --> 00:01:01,963
The grid button on the left always takes you to all the apps.

15
00:01:02,850 --> 00:01:09,359
The Dashboard shows how the business is doing: invoiced, collected, receivables,

16
00:01:09,359 --> 00:01:16,193
open quotations, new leads and installations, with charts and an India map of sales.

17
00:01:17,090 --> 00:01:22,983
The bell shows what needs action today: overdue payments, follow-ups,

18
00:01:22,983 --> 00:01:26,912
delayed projects, low stock and expiring AMCs.

19
00:01:26,912 --> 00:01:29,731
Tap an alert to open that record.

20
00:01:30,650 --> 00:01:36,131
Your account menu is at the top right: your profile, settings and sign out.

21
00:01:36,131 --> 00:01:39,127
In the next videos we set up the company,

22
00:01:39,127 --> 00:01:43,805
then follow a customer from enquiry to installation and payment.

23
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:49,659
Next video: Getting started: create your account and install the app.

